\par \'a7\'dea gi\'edi h\'b5nh ch\'ddnh ph\'ad\'eang Qu\'b8n B\'b5u: \'a7\'abng gi\'b8p ph\'ad\'eang H\'b5 Huy T\'cbp; T\'a9y gi\'b8p ph\'ad\'eang \'a7\'abng V\'dcnh v\'b5 x\'b7 H\'adng \'a7\'abng; Nam gi\'b8p c\'b8c ph\'ad\'eang L\'aa L\'eei, H\'adng B\'d7
